{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1113; --card:#0e1412; --muted:#9aa6a1; --accent:#c9f0e1; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      --maxw:1100px; --radius:14px; font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071014 0%,var(--bg) 100%);color:#e7efe9;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:32px auto;padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b5b4a, #103a66);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);}
    .logo svg{width:40px;height:40px;transform:rotate(-12deg)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a.active, nav a:hover{color:var(--accent);background:var(--glass)}

    main{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,6,0.6);overflow:hidden}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:26px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:var(--muted)}

    .card{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:inherit;font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .row > *{flex:1}
    .btn{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0fb08a,#2ad1b0);color:#043128;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    aside .info{position:sticky;top:28px}
    .meta{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px}

    .try-wrap{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    .try-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--accent);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}

    /* Reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px) scale(0.995);transition:opacity 600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1),transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    /* Breathing circle */
    .breath-stage{display:grid;place-items:center;gap:14px}
    .circle{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(201,240,225,0.9), rgba(201,240,225,0.12));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#043128;font-weight:700}
    .circle.shrink{transform:scale(0.6)}

    /* Modal */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(3,7,9,0.6),rgba(3,7,9,0.85));display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:28px}
    .modal{width:100%;max-width:720px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:20px}
    .modal.active{display:block}

    footer{margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* decorative pattern background */
    .hero-pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.06;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:240px}

    @media (max-width:900px){.wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}.brand .logo{width:48px;height:48px}.circle{width:96px;height:96px}}

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none!important;transform:none!important;opacity:1!important}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="hero-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="reveal" data-delay="0">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- small bespoke glyph -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M3 12c2-6 9-9 13-6 4 3 4 11 0 14C12 23 5 18 3 12z" fill="white" opacity="0.9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">A place to reset with sound & presence</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Packages</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="active">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <h1 class="reveal" data-delay="80">Reach out, ask about a session, or just say hello</h1>
      <p class="lead reveal" data-delay="160">If you’re curious about group events, booking private time, or wondering what a single session can feel like, use this form. We typically reply within 48 hours. You can also call or email us directly.</p>

      <section class="card reveal" data-delay="260" id="contact-form">
        <form id="form">
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Your full name">

          <div style="height:12px"></div>
          <div class="row">
            <div>
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com">
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="height:12px"></div>
          <label for="interest">I'm interested in</label>
          <select id="interest" name="interest">
            <option>Group gatherings</option>
            <option>Private session</option>
            <option>Corporate / team experience</option>
            <option>Teaching & collaboration</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>

          <div style="height:12px"></div>
          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us a bit about what you’re looking for..."></textarea>

          <div style="height:14px"></div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
            <button class="btn" type="submit">Send enquiry</button>
            <button type="button" class="try-btn" id="open-try">Try it now</button>
            <div class="muted" style="margin-left:auto">Prefer to call? <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section class="card reveal" data-delay="400">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Visiting & COVID / health notes</h3>
        <p class="muted">Arrive 10 minutes early for check-in. We maintain sanitized spaces and gentle ventilation between sessions.</p>

        <h4 style="margin:14px 0 6px 0">Contraindications — please read</h4>
        <p class="muted">Sound work is a gentle adjunct practice, but it is not appropriate for everyone. Please consult a medical professional before attending if you have any of the following: epilepsy, uncontrolled heart conditions, recent major surgery, pregnancy (first-trimester consult recommended), or severe psychiatric conditions such as active psychosis. If you’re unsure, contact us and we’ll speak about how to make sessions safe for you.</p>
      </section>

      <footer class="reveal" data-delay="540">
        <div>Prefer email? <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px" class="muted">We hold a limited number of seats each month to preserve a quiet, intentional container for each gathering.</div>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <aside class="info">
      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="220" style="text-align:left">
        <div class="meta">Reach & hours</div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Mon — Fri • 9:00 — 17:00 (reply hours)</div>

        <div style="height:10px"></div>
        <div class="meta">Quick contact</div>
        <div class="muted">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        <div class="muted">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>
        <div class="meta">Need to book right away?</div>
        <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:6px">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="340">
        <h4 style="margin-top:0">Short practice — try from here</h4>
        <p class="muted">If you’re unsure what a practice feels like, try our guided three-minute exercise. It’s built to be quiet, simple, and accessible.</p>
        <div style="height:12px"></div>
        <div class="try-wrap">
          <button class="btn" id="open-try-2">Try a quick breath</button>
          <button class="try-btn" id="open-try-3">Guided intention</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal: Try it now -->
  <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:8px">
        <strong id="modal-title">Try a short guided exercise</strong>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
          <div class="muted" id="cycle-indicator"> </div>
          <button class="try-btn" id="close-try" aria-label="Close">Close</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div style="flex:1 1 320px">
          <label for="mode" class="muted">Choose a practice</label>
          <select id="mode">
            <option value="breath">Breathing (3 cycles)</option>
            <option value="journaling">Journaling (5 min prompt)</option>
            <option value="intention">Intention setting (2 mins)</option>
          </select>

          <div style="height:12px"></div>
          <div id="exercise-area">
            <div class="breath-stage" id="breath-ui" style="display:none">
              <div class="circle" id="breath-circle" aria-hidden="true">Breathe</div>
              <div id="breath-text" class="muted">Prepare to breathe with a soft inhale...</div>
            </div>

            <div id="journal-ui" style="display:none">
              <div class="muted">Prompt for 5 minutes: “What do I want to let go of right now?”</div>
              <textarea id="journal-input" placeholder="Jot a sentence or free write for a few minutes..."></textarea>
              <div style="height:10px"></div>
              <div class="muted" id="journal-timer">Timer: 05:00</div>
            </div>

            <div id="intent-ui" style="display:none">
              <div class="muted">A brief pause to set an intention. Breathe softly and choose one phrase.</div>
              <div style="height:10px"></div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
                <button class="try-btn intent-choice">I choose calm</button>
                <button class="try-btn intent-choice">I choose clarity</button>
                <button class="try-btn intent-choice">I choose presence</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div style="width:220px;flex-shrink:0">
          <div class="card muted" style="padding:12px">
            <div style="font-weight:700">How it works</div>
            <p class="muted">This guided exercise runs locally in your browser. No audio, no sign-in. Choose a mode and follow the prompts. If you prefer no movement, enable reduced motion in your OS settings.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Accessible scroll-triggered reveal
    (function(){
      var prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){
        reveals.forEach(function(r){r.classList.add('visible')});
        return;
      }

      if('IntersectionObserver' in window){
        var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
          entries.forEach(function(e){
            if(e.isIntersecting){
              var el = e.target; var delay = el.getAttribute('data-delay') || 0;
              setTimeout(function(){el.classList.add('visible')}, Number(delay));
              io.unobserve(el);
            }
          });
        },{threshold:0.12});
        reveals.forEach(function(r){io.observe(r)});
      } else {
        // fallback: simple on-scroll check
        function onScroll(){
          reveals.forEach(function(el){
            if(el.classList.contains('visible')) return;
            var rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();
            if(rect.top < window.innerHeight - 60){ el.classList.add('visible'); }
          });
        }
        window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, {passive:true});
        onScroll();
      }
    })();

    // Try-it-now modal and exercise logic
    (function(){
      var modal = document.getElementById('modal');
      var open = document.getElementById('open-try');
      var open2 = document.getElementById('open-try-2');
      var open3 = document.getElementById('open-try-3');
      var close = document.getElementById('close-try');
      var mode = document.getElementById('mode');
      var breathUI = document.getElementById('breath-ui');
      var journalUI = document.getElementById('journal-ui');
      var intentUI = document.getElementById('intent-ui');
      var circle = document.getElementById('breath-circle');
      var btext = document.getElementById('breath-text');
      var cycleIndicator = document.getElementById('cycle-indicator');
      var journalTimer = document.getElementById('journal-timer');

      function openModal(){ modal.style.display='flex'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); startMode(); }
      function closeModal(){ modal.style.display='none'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); stopAll(); }

      open.addEventListener('click', openModal);
      open2.addEventListener('click', function(){ openModal(); mode.value='breath'; startMode(); });
      open3.addEventListener('click', function(){ openModal(); mode.value='intention'; startMode(); });
      close.addEventListener('click', closeModal);

      modal.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if(e.target===modal){ closeModal(); } });

      var breathTimerId=null, journalTimerId=null, journalSeconds=300;
      var cy=0, maxCycles=3; var animating=true;

      function stopAll(){
        if(breathTimerId) clearTimeout(breathTimerId);
        if(journalTimerId) clearInterval(journalTimerId);
        journalseconds=journalSeconds; // reset
        if(circle) circle.classList.remove('shrink');
        cycleIndicator.textContent='';
      }

      function startMode(){ stopAll(); updateUI(); if(mode.value==='breath') startBreath(); if(mode.value==='journaling') startJournal(); if(mode.value==='intention') startIntent(); }
      mode.addEventListener('change', startMode);

      // Reduced motion respects user OS pref
      var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

      function startBreath(){ cy=0; maxCycles=3; cycleIndicator.textContent='Cycle 0 / '+maxCycles;
        function oneCycle(){
          if(cy>=maxCycles){ cycleIndicator.textContent='Done'; btext.textContent='Nice — whenever ready, gently come back.'; return; }
          cy++; cycleIndicator.textContent='Cycle '+cy+' / '+maxCycles;
          btext.textContent='Inhale…';
          if(!reduce) circle.classList.remove('shrink');
          // inhale for 4s
          breathTimerId = setTimeout(function(){ btext.textContent='Hold…'; if(!reduce) circle.classList.add('shrink');
            // hold 3s
            breathTimerId = setTimeout(function(){ btext.textContent='Exhale…'; if(!reduce) circle.classList.remove('shrink');
              // exhale 6s
              breathTimerId = setTimeout(function(){ oneCycle(); }, 6000);
            },3000);
          },4000);
        }
        oneCycle();
      }

      function startJournal(){ journalUI.style.display='block'; journalTimer = journalSeconds; updateJournalTimer(); journalTimerId = setInterval(function(){ journalTimer--; updateJournalTimer(); if(journalTimer<=0){ clearInterval(journalTimerId); journalTimerId=null; journalTimer=journalSeconds; journalTimerId=null; document.getElementById('journal-input').placeholder='Finished. Press close when ready.'; } },1000); }
      function updateJournalTimer(){ var mm = String(Math.floor(journalTimer/60)).padStart(2,'0'); var ss = String(journalTimer%60).padStart(2,'0'); journalTimer = Math.max(0,journalTimer); journalTimerId && (journalTimerId=journalTimerId); journalTimer && (journalTimer); journalTimer = journalTimer; journalTimerId; journalTimer; journalTimer; document.getElementById('journal-timer').textContent = 'Timer: '+mm+':'+ss; }

      function startIntent(){ cycleIndicator.textContent='2:00'; var remaining=120; var id=setInterval(function(){ remaining--; var mm = Math.floor(remaining/60); var ss = remaining%60; cycleIndicator.textContent = (mm?mm+':':'') + String(ss).padStart(2,'0'); if(remaining<=0){ clearInterval(id); cycleIndicator.textContent='Done'; } },1000); }

      function updateUI(){ breathUI.style.display='none'; journalUI.style.display='none'; intentUI.style.display='none'; if(mode.value==='breath'){ breathUI.style.display='block'; } else if(mode.value==='journaling'){ journalUI.style.display='block'; } else if(mode.value==='intention'){ intentUI.style.display='block'; } }

      // journal timer formatting initial call
      updateJournalTimer();

      // simple intent buttons
      var choices = document.querySelectorAll('.intent-choice');
      choices.forEach(function(b){ b.addEventListener('click', function(){ choices.forEach(function(x){x.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.06)'}); this.style.borderColor='var(--accent)'; document.getElementById('modal-title').textContent = 'Intention: "'+this.textContent+'"'; }); });

      // form submit handling (no backend) - provide mailto summary
      var form = document.getElementById('form');
      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){ e.preventDefault(); var data = new FormData(form); var body = 'Name: '+(data.get('name')||'')+'\nEmail: '+(data.get('email')||'')+'\nPhone: '+(data.get('phone')||'')+'\nInterest: '+(data.get('interest')||'')+'\n\nMessage:\n'+(data.get('message')||''); var mail = 'mailto:'+encodeURIComponent('{{EMAIL}}')+'?subject='+encodeURIComponent('Contact from site')+'&body='+encodeURIComponent(body); window.location.href = mail; });

      // ensure keyboard accessibility for modal close
      document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key === 'Escape'){ if(modal.style.display==='flex'){ closeModal(); } } });

      // show selected UI when modal is opened
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', function(){ if(document.visibilityState==='visible') updateUI(); });
    })();

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Project: sound_bath site — chunk: contact

Overview:
This chunk produces the contact page (contact.html) and this README. The site is a small static front-end built as part of a larger sound bath events project. Replace placeholders in the HTML with your real details before publishing.

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html: The contact page, containing a contact form, local "Try it now" guided exercise modal, accessibility-conscious scroll reveal, and visitor notes including contraindications.
- README.md: This documentation file.

Placeholders to replace (case-sensitive):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}} (kept for other pages)
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

How to preview locally:
1. Ensure the overall project folder contains the other pages (index.html, events.html, private-sessions.html, pricing.html, about.html, faq.html, book.html) and the asset at assets/img/pattern.svg.
2. In a simple static environment open contact.html in a browser (no server required). For more features or CORS-safe requests, run a local static server: e.g. python -m http.server

Key features implemented in contact.html:
- Accessible scroll-triggered reveal: Elements marked with class "reveal" animate into view using IntersectionObserver. If the user prefers reduced motion, reveals disable animation and render instantly.
- "Try it now" guided exercise modal: A client-side-only modal offers three modes:
  - Breathing: three cycles of inhale/hold/exhale with subtle visual circle animation (respects prefers-reduced-motion).
  - Journaling: a 5-minute prompt with a local countdown timer and a small textarea for notes.
  - Intention setting: short 2-minute timer and quick-intent buttons.
  The modal runs entirely in-browser; no external audio or network is used.
- Contact form: Because this is a static demo, form submission is handled by generating a mailto: link using the provided {{EMAIL}} placeholder. This avoids the need for a backend while still offering a practical flow.
- Contraindications disclaimer: A clear, responsible medical advisory is included in the contact content.

Accessibility notes:
- The page respects prefers-reduced-motion for both the scroll reveals and the breathing animation.
- Modal uses role="dialog" and aria-hidden toggling. Escape closes the modal. Clicking backdrop closes the modal.
- Color contrast is considered; however test in target environments and adjust variables in the :root for brand colors.

Assets required elsewhere:
- assets/img/pattern.svg: referenced by the page as a repeating background. The main project should include a bespoke SVG pattern. No external fonts or CDNs are required.

Integration pointers:
- Navigation links point to the canonical page names used across the site. If you rename pages, update the nav accordingly.
- The contact form currently uses mailto: to deliver messages. To hook up a real form backend, change the form action and remove the JavaScript mailto handling.

Security & privacy:
- This implementation does not store or transmit data to third-party services. If you integrate a form provider, review its privacy policy and ensure you obtain consent where required.

Developer notes:
- The code avoids third-party libraries. IntersectionObserver is preferred; an on-scroll fallback is provided for older browsers.
- The breathing animation toggles a simple class on the visual element; if your brand has motion guidelines, replace with a designer-approved sequence.

If you need additional pages or another chunk, request the files with the same NDJSON format."}
